# Formspring product routing

When the Formspring MCP server is connected:

| User wants | MCP tool | Do not use |
| --- | --- | --- |
| Contact / lead form (one screen) | `create_form` | `create_survey`, `create_funnel` |
| Multi-screen survey, quiz, NPS | `create_survey` | `create_form` |
| Multi-step funnel, quiz funnel | `create_funnel` | `create_form` |
| Short link / QR | `create_link` | — |

- Discover starters with `list_templates` (`product`: `form`, `survey`, or `funnel`).
- On **Free** plans, survey/funnel/webhook/AI tools may be hidden — explain Pro+ instead of inventing tools.
- Customer-facing copy: say **Formspring** only; do not expose internal stack or codenames.
